# n8n's root .gitignore excludes **/package-lock.json because the monorepo is
# pnpm-only. norra/app is a standalone npm project outside that workspace, so
# its lockfile has to be tracked -- otherwise Vercel resolves different versions
# than the ones verified here.
!package-lock.json
